  "historyNote": "#5251, eff 10-21-91; amd by #5502, eff 11-12-92; amd by #6604, INTERIM, eff 10-18-97, EXPIRED 2-15-98; ss and moved by #6663, eff 1-1-98 (from Saf-C 2007), EXPIRED: 1-1-06 New. #8569, INTERIM, eff 2-18-06, EXPIRED: 8-17-06 New. #8966, eff 8-23-07; ss by #11028, eff 1-29-16",
